# AITA Project - Complete Entity Documentation

## 1. User Management

### User
**Purpose:** Core user entity for all system participants (students, lecturers, admins)

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| Id | UUID (PK) | Primary identifier |
| Email | String (Unique) | User email address |
| PasswordHash | String | Hashed password |
| FullName | String | User's full name |
| StudentCode | String | Student ID (if student) |
| Phone | String | Contact number |
| Avatar | String | Avatar image URL |
| Status | String | Active/Inactive/Locked |
| LastLoginAt | DateTime | Last login timestamp |
| RequirePasswordChange | Boolean | Force password change on next login |
| ResetPasswordOtp | String | One-time password for reset |
| ResetPasswordOtpExpiry | DateTime | OTP expiration time |

**Relations:** Creates/owns multiple entities (StudentClass, InstructorClass, Submission, Exam, etc.)

---

### UserRole
**Purpose:** Link users to roles (many-to-many junction)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| UserId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| RoleId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| AssignedAt | DateTime |

**Relations:** User → UserRole → Role

---

### Role
**Purpose:** Define system roles (ADMIN, LECTURER, STUDENT)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| RoleName | String (Unique) |

---

### RefreshToken
**Purpose:** OAuth refresh token management

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| UserId | UUID (FK) |
| Token | String |
| ExpiresAt | DateTime |
| IsRevoked | Boolean |

---

### OAuthIdentity
**Purpose:** Third-party OAuth provider credentials

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| UserId | UUID (FK) |
| Provider | String (e.g., Google, Microsoft) |
| ProviderId | String |
| AccessToken | String |
| RefreshToken | String |

**Unique:** [Provider, ProviderId]

---

## 2. Academic Structure

### Semester
**Purpose:** Time period grouping for academic year (Spring, Summer, Fall)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| Season | String (e.g., "Spring 2024") |
| Code | String (e.g., "SP24") |
| StartDate | DateTime |
| EndDate | DateTime |
| IsActive | Boolean |

**Unique:** [Season, Code]

---

### Subject
**Purpose:** Academic subjects/courses

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| SubjectCode | String (Unique, e.g., "PRO232") |
| SubjectName | String (e.g., "Database Systems") |
| Description | String |
| IsActive | Boolean |
| Semester | Int | **Semester number the subject belongs to (e.g., 2nd or 3rd semester)** |

**Key:** Used to determine which semester a subject inherently belongs to for retake logic

---

### SemesterSubject
**Purpose:** Map subjects to semesters (many-to-many junction, enables cross-semester availability)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| SemesterId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| SubjectId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| AssignedAt | DateTime |

**Relations:** Semester ↔ SemesterSubject ↔ Subject

**Use Case:** A subject like PRO232 can exist in multiple semesters for retake options

---

### Class
**Purpose:** Specific offerings of a subject in a semester with instructor

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| ClassCode | String (e.g., "SE18C01") |
| SubjectId | UUID (FK) |
| SemesterId | UUID (FK) |
| Status | String (Active/Inactive) |
| Note | String | Admin notes |

**Unique:** [ClassCode, SubjectId, SemesterId]

**Relations:** Semester, Subject → Class → InstructorClass, StudentClass, Submission

---

## 3. Enrollment & Participation

### StudentClass
**Purpose:** Student enrollment in a class (many-to-many)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| UserId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| ClassId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| EnrolledAt | DateTime |

**Cascade:** Deletes when class deleted

**Use Case:** Main enrollment tracking for normal classes and retakes

---

### InstructorClass
**Purpose:** Instructor assignment to a class

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| UserId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| ClassId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| EnrolledAt | DateTime |

---

### PendingEnrollment
**Purpose:** Track pending/queued student enrollments (for import batches, retakes, debt subjects)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| UserId | UUID (FK) |
| SemesterCode | String |
| Season | String |
| ClassCode | String |
| SubjectCode | String |
| Status | String (Default: "Pending") |
| CreatedAt | DateTime |
| UpdatedAt | DateTime |

**Use Case:** Holds enrollment requests before confirmation (used for retake/debt subject imports)

---

### Appeal
**Purpose:** Grade/submission appeals by students

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| SubmissionId | UUID (FK) |
| StudentId | UUID (FK) |
| Reason | String |
| Status | String (Pending/Approved/Rejected) |
| CreatedAt | DateTime |
| ResolvedAt | DateTime |
| Resolution | String |

---

## 4. Assignments & Submissions

### Exam
