| GradingProfileId | UUID (FK) |
| SubjectId | UUID (FK) |
| ExamType | String (Assignment/Exam/Project) |
| Duration | Int (minutes) |
| StartDate | DateTime |
| DueDate | DateTime |
| TotalPoints | Decimal |
| Status | String (Draft/Published/Closed) |
| SubmissionFormat | String (Code/Document/etc) |
| AiGeneratedContent | String |
| OriginalPrompt | String |
| PromptTemplateId | UUID (FK) |
| CreatedBy | UUID (FK - User) |

**Relations:** ExamClass (many-to-many with Class), Submission, ExamAttachment, ExamSection, TestCase

