### ExamClass
**Purpose:** Map exams to classes (which students can submit)

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| ExamId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| ClassId | UUID (FK/PK) |
| AssignedAt | DateTime |
| DueDate | DateTime |

---

### Submission
**Purpose:** Student submission of exam/assignment

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| Id | UUID (PK) |
| ExamId | UUID (FK) |
| StudentId | UUID (FK - User) |
| ClassId | UUID (FK) |
| AttemptNumber | Int |
| IsLatest | Boolean |
| SubmittedAt | DateTime |
| ZipFileUrl | String |
| GradingStatus | String (Pending/In Progress/Completed) |
| ReviewStatus | String (Pending/Reviewed) |
| TotalScore | Decimal |
| FinalScore | Decimal |
| InstructorFeedback | String |
| StudentFeedback | String |
| ReviewedBy | UUID (FK - User) |
